        "name": "Will you damage my door or lock to get me inside?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. We specialize in non-destructive lock picking and bypass techniques that open your door without damaging the lock, door, or frame. In the vast majority of residential lockouts, your lock is fully operational after we open it."
        }
