            Our technicians use precision lock picking tools and bypass techniques specifically designed for residential pin tumbler locks â€” the most common lock type found in Delaware homes. In most cases, your lock is fully functional after we open it and requires no repair or replacement unless you choose to upgrade.
          </p>
