          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Keys Locked Inside â€” Non-Destructive Entry</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            The most common house lockout â€” you stepped outside briefly and the door locked behind you, or you left your keys on the counter on the way out. Our technicians open standard residential deadbolts and knob locks using professional pick sets without any damage to the lock or door hardware.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We carry picks, tension wrenches, and bypass tools for the most common residential lock brands including Kwikset, Schlage, Defiant, Yale, and Baldwin. Most residential pin tumbler locks can be picked open in a matter of minutes by an experienced technician.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            If you have multiple locks on your door â€” a deadbolt and a knob lock â€” we open both and confirm all entry points are secure before we leave.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 5.25a3 3 0 013 3m3 0a6 6 0 01-7.029 5.912c-.563-.097-1.159.026-1.563.43L10.5 17.25H8.25v2.25H6v2.25H2.25v-2.818c0-.597.237-1.17.659-1.591l6.499-6.499c.404-.404.527-1 .43-1.563A6 6 0 1121.75 8.25z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Lost Key House Lockout & Security Rekey</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            If you have genuinely lost your house keys â€” not just locked them inside â€” you face a two-part problem. First, we get you inside. Second, the lost key is now a security risk, especially if it has a tag with your address or could be traced to your home in any way.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We strongly recommend combining the emergency entry with an immediate <a href="/services/lock-rekeying/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">lock rekey</a> on the same visit. Rekeying reconfigures the internal pins so the lost key no longer works â€” your doors are secured before we leave, and no old keys can open them.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            If your locks are older or you want higher-grade security hardware while we are there, we can also install new <a href="/services/deadbolt-installation/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">ANSI Grade 1 deadbolts</a> on the same visit.
          </p>
        </div>

