              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.42 15.17L17.25 21A2.652 2.652 0 0021 17.25l-5.877-5.877M11.42 15.17l2.496-3.03c.317-.384.74-.626 1.208-.766M11.42 15.17l-4.655 5.653a2.548 2.548 0 11-3.586-3.586l6.837-5.63m5.108-.233c.55-.164 1.163-.188 1.743-.14a4.5 4.5 0 004.486-6.336l-3.276 3.277a3.004 3.004 0 01-2.25-2.25l3.276-3.276a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.336 4.486c.091 1.076-.071 2.264-.904 2.95l-.102.085m-1.745 1.437L5.909 7.5H4.5L2.25 3.75l1.5-1.5L7.5 4.5v1.409l4.26 4.26m-1.745 1.437l1.745-1.437m6.615 8.206L15.75 15.75M4.867 19.125h.008v.008h-.008v-.008z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Broken Key in House Door Lock</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            A broken key in the front door lock is a complete lockout â€” you cannot insert a spare key, cannot pick the lock normally, and the door is completely inaccessible until the fragment is removed. This is one of the most frustrating lockout situations, particularly because it can happen suddenly with no warning.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Our technicians carry dedicated <a href="/services/broken-key-extraction/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">broken key extraction</a> tools â€” professional spiral extractors and hook picks that reach into the key channel, grip the fragment, and remove it cleanly without damaging the internal cylinder pins.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Once the fragment is removed, if the cylinder is still in good condition we cut a new key and have you back inside. If the cylinder was damaged in the break, we can replace it with a new cylinder keyed to your existing spare key or a new key set.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
